              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "EC2 instance without IMDSv2 enforcement"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Without metadata_options.http_tokens = \"required\", the instance metadata service accepts IMDSv1 requests, which SSRF vulnerabilities can abuse to steal credentials.\n\nHow to fix:\nEnforce IMDSv2 on the instance / launch template:\nmetadata_options {\n  http_endpoint = \"enabled\"\n  http_tokens   = \"required\"   # IMDSv2 only\n  http_put_response_hop_limit = 1\n}"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/configuring-instance-metadata-service.html",
              "properties": {
                "severity": "high"
