              "id": "AEGIS-AWS-206",
              "name": "S3 bucket without public access block",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "S3 bucket without public access block"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Without an aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block enabling all four protections (block_public_acls, block_public_policy, ignore_public_acls, restrict_public_buckets), a single permissive ACL or policy can expose the bucket. Fail-safe: only a proven all-four-true block silences this rule.\n\nHow to fix:\nAdd the public access block resource (see AEGIS-AWS-003 fix). All four settings\nmust be true for full protection."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/access-control-block-public-access.html",
