              "help": {
                "text": "Without an aws_flow_log attached to the VPC, network traffic metadata is not captured and incident investigation is blind. Fail-safe: a VPC with no linked flow log is flagged. VPCs with no subnets carry no traffic and are skipped.\n\nHow to fix:\nEnable audit logging. Turn on CloudTrail (multi-region, log file validation, KMS-encrypted bucket), VPC flow logs, and service access logs. Ship logs to a dedicated, MFA-delete-protected bucket in a security account."
              },
