                "text": "Without image_scanning_configuration { scan_on_push = true }, vulnerable images are pushed and deployed without any scan.\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/securityhub/latest/userguide/securityhub-standards.html",
