                "text": "An AWS Transfer Family server with endpoint_type PUBLIC accepts SFTP/FTPS connections from the internet instead of being restricted to a VPC endpoint.\n\nHow to fix:\nRemove public exposure. Restrict ingress to known CIDR ranges, move the resource into private subnets, and front it with a load balancer or API gateway if external access is required. Verify with `aws ec2 describe-security-groups`."
              },
