                "text": "Load balancer listener without HTTP-to-HTTPS redirect"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A port-80 listener whose default_action does not redirect to HTTPS serves traffic in plaintext instead of upgrading clients to an encrypted connection.\n\nHow to fix:\nEnforce TLS 1.2+. Replace HTTP listeners with HTTPS, set a modern TLS policy (e.g. `ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13-1-2-2021-06`), and redirect HTTP→HTTPS. Disable weak ciphers and old protocol versions everywhere."
