              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A SageMaker notebook instance without subnet_id runs outside a customer VPC, so its traffic and data access are not governed by VPC network controls.\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
