              "help": {
                "text": "copy_tags_to_snapshot is absent or false, so automated snapshots lose the cluster's tags, breaking tag-based access control and cost allocation on restores.\n\nHow to fix:\nEnable data protection. Turn on versioning / point-in-time recovery / automated backups with a retention period ≥ 7 days (30+ for production). Test restores regularly — untested backups are not backups."
