              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A container in aws_ecs_task_definition's container_definitions without logConfiguration sends stdout/stderr only to the Docker daemon log, which is ephemeral and invisible to CloudWatch. Add a logConfiguration with the awslogs driver so container output is centralized and auditable.\n\nHow to fix:\nEnable audit logging. Turn on CloudTrail (multi-region, log file validation, KMS-encrypted bucket), VPC flow logs, and service access logs. Ship logs to a dedicated, MFA-delete-protected bucket in a security account."
              },
