                "text": "An aws_api_gateway_stage with xray_tracing_enabled unset or false (the provider default) emits no X-Ray traces, losing distributed visibility into API requests. Enable X-Ray tracing on the stage.\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
