                "text": "API Gateway deployment without a description"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "An aws_api_gateway_deployment without a description is indistinguishable from other deployments in history, slowing rollback decisions during incidents. Describe what each deployment changes.\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
