              "help": {
                "text": "A CloudTrail trail with enable_logging = false exists but records nothing, leaving API activity unaudited while looking configured. (KMS coverage is AEGIS-AWS-568.)\n\nHow to fix:\nEnable audit logging. Turn on CloudTrail (multi-region, log file validation, KMS-encrypted bucket), VPC flow logs, and service access logs. Ship logs to a dedicated, MFA-delete-protected bucket in a security account."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awscloudtrail/latest/userguide/cloudtrail-user-guide.html",
