                "text": "A topic with kms_master_key_id explicitly set to alias/aws/sns encrypts with the AWS-managed key, which the account cannot rotate or control via key policy. Consider a customer-managed key for full key control. (Missing kms_master_key_id is AEGIS-AWS-341.)\n\nHow to fix:\nEnable encryption at rest. For AWS-managed keys add the service's encryption block (e.g. `storage_encrypted = true` for RDS, `server_side_encryption_configuration` for S3). For regulated data use a customer-managed KMS key via `kms_key_id` and enable key rotation."
