              "help": {
                "text": "A subscription with no redrive_policy block drops messages that exhaust delivery retries, silently losing notifications during endpoint outages. (Plaintext HTTP delivery is AEGIS-AWS-426.)\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
              },
