              },
              "help": {
                "text": "An ALB listener whose ssl_policy references a 2016-era or TLS-1-0 policy negotiates weak ciphers and obsolete TLS versions. Use a current ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13 policy.\n\nHow to fix:\nApply least privilege. Replace wildcard (`*`) actions and resources with the minimum scoped ARNs the workload needs. Split policy authoring from attachment. Use IAM Access Analyzer to generate scoped policies from CloudTrail history."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/best-practices.html",
              "properties": {
                "severity": "medium"
