              },
              "help": {
                "text": "azurerm_mssql_server with no azurerm_mssql_server_extended_auditing_policy referencing it loses the database activity audit trail. Attach an extended auditing policy with a storage endpoint.\n\nHow to fix:\nAttach an extended auditing policy to the server:\nresource \"azurerm_mssql_server_extended_auditing_policy\" \"audit\" {\n  server_id                  = azurerm_mssql_server.db.id\n  storage_endpoint           = azurerm_storage_account.audit.primary_blob_endpoint\n  storage_account_access_key = azurerm_storage_account.audit.primary_access_key\n  retention_in_days          = 90\n}"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/azurerm/latest/docs/resources/mssql_server_extended_auditing_policy",
              "properties": {
                "severity": "medium"
