                "text": "azurerm_mssql_server_extended_auditing_policy with retention_in_days \u003c 90 discards audit logs too early for investigation. Retain at least 90 days.\n\nHow to fix:\nRaise the audit log retention on the extended auditing policy:\nresource \"azurerm_mssql_server_extended_auditing_policy\" \"audit\" {\n  retention_in_days = 90\n}"
              },
