                "text": "azurerm_mssql_server with minimum_tls_version absent or below \"1.2\" permits older, weaker protocol versions in transit. Set minimum_tls_version = \"1.2\".\n\nHow to fix:\nEnforce TLS 1.2 on the server:\nresource \"azurerm_mssql_server\" \"db\" {\n  minimum_tls_version = \"1.2\"\n}"
              },
