              "help": {
                "text": "azurerm_mssql_server with no azurerm_mssql_server_azuread_administrator referencing it relies solely on SQL authentication. Configure an Azure AD administrator for centralized identity.\n\nHow to fix:\nAdd an Azure AD administrator to the server:\nresource \"azurerm_mssql_server_azuread_administrator\" \"ad\" {\n  server_id                   = azurerm_mssql_server.db.id\n  login_username              = \"sql-admin\"\n  object_id                   = data.azuread_user.admin.object_id\n  tenant_id                   = data.azurerm_client_config.current.tenant_id\n  azuread_authentication_only = true\n}"
