                "text": "Container image uses latest tag"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A container image without an explicit tag (implicit :latest) or with the :latest tag is not reproducible: the image can change under you and rollbacks are unreliable. Pin images by digest or immutable version tag.\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
