                "text": "Container without liveness probe"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A container without a livenessProbe is never restarted when it deadlocks, leaving a broken pod serving traffic. Define a liveness probe.\n\nHow to fix:\nReview the flagged configuration against AWS security best practices and the CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Apply the control the rule describes, preferring restrictive defaults, encryption, and audit logging. Validate with `aegis scan` after the change."
